title: "Record"
order: "04"
summary: >-
  The record and what derives from it: writers, events, addresses, segments, seals, provenance and origin⟦f:landmarks⟧, spans and landmarks⟦/f⟧, quarantine⟦f:purge-retention⟧ and purge⟦/f⟧⟦f:store-protection⟧, receipts, backups⟦/f⟧⟦f:export-bundles⟧, bundles and exports⟦/f⟧.
